<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3749/54 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7300/10 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9459/69 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4335/45 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.71/71  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8433/43   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1702.8/3.4  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.56/61   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7930/80   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1750/90   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5885/05   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6352/62</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$343.30/70</p>
</text>
